    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\"><style>[data-colorid=zgazezknyt]{color:#4d4d4d} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=zgazezknyt]{color:#b2b2b2}</style>\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h1 id=\"BacteriologyResultsControl-Purpose\">Purpose</h1><p>Bacteriology results control is used to list the bacteriology samples and the corresponding results captured against those samples (for a particular patient)</p><h1 id=\"BacteriologyResultsControl-Screenshot\">Screenshot</h1><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114206168/Screen%20Shot%202016-05-25%20at%203.37.34%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1484669472228&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=86\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/114206168/Screen%20Shot%202016-05-25%20at%203.37.34%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1484669472228&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114206099\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-05-25 at 3.37.34 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"114206168\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"cc3788a1-6d20-4b22-bdd2-ebe66e1ab9c5\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114206168/Screen%20Shot%202016-05-25%20at%203.37.34%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1484669472228&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1200&amp;height=172 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114206168/Screen%20Shot%202016-05-25%20at%203.37.34%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1484669472228&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=86 1x\" /></span></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114206168/Screen%20Shot%202016-05-25%20at%203.37.50%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1484669471423&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=395\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/114206168/Screen%20Shot%202016-05-25%20at%203.37.50%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1484669471423&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114206103\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-05-25 at 3.37.50 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"114206168\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"29404aee-c001-4d06-83fc-b954509ccfec\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114206168/Screen%20Shot%202016-05-25%20at%203.37.50%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1484669471423&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1200&amp;height=790 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114206168/Screen%20Shot%202016-05-25%20at%203.37.50%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1484669471423&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=395 1x\" /></span></p><h1 id=\"BacteriologyResultsControl-Configuration\">Configuration</h1><h3 id=\"BacteriologyResultsControl-SampleConfig\">Sample Config</h3><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"7999b036-cde0-4af3-bdbe-c82c7f1b044b\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader pdl\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>Add to clinical/dashboard.json for it to appear on the patient dashboard</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: true; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">&quot;bacteriologyResults&quot;: {\n    &quot;translationKey&quot;: &quot;DASHBOARD_TITLE_BACTERIOLOGY_RESULTS_KEY&quot;,\n    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;bacteriologyResultsControl&quot;,\n    &quot;displayOrder&quot;: 4,\n    &quot;dashboardConfig&quot;: {\n        &quot;conceptNames&quot;: [&quot;BACTERIOLOGY CONCEPT SET&quot;]\n    },\n    &quot;hideEmptyDisplayControl&quot;:&nbsp;false\n}</pre>\n</div></div><h3 id=\"BacteriologyResultsControl-KeyFieldTable\">Key Field Table</h3><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"wrapped confluenceTable\"><colgroup><col /><col /><col /></colgroup><tbody><tr><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Key</th><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Info</th><th colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTh\">Mandatory</th></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\">title</td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p>Indicates the title that will be displayed on the dashboard for the section</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">Y</td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\">type</td><td class=\"confluenceTd\">The name/type of the display control that needs to be picked from the code</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">Y</td></tr><tr><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><pre>dashboardConfig</pre></td><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><p><span data-colorid=\"zgazezknyt\">Indicates the configuration for the dashboard</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">Y</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">conceptNames</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">Concepts of observations to be chosen for display</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">N</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">displayOrder</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">Relative position of the display control with respect to other display controls on the patient dashboard.</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">N</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p class=\"p1\">hideEmptyDisplayControl</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><p class=\"p1\">Hides the display control if there are no recorded values present for it when set to true, default value is set to false</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">N</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"9e21e6bc-65b4-4f30-a341-0dc091c2e859\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"c600f8c4-b8b4-4eb8-bd41-e903ed368a03\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"11c594ed-5883-4869-a352-0f4f6562d86e\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: White;\"><b>Related Display Controls</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p> </p><ul class=\"childpages-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"3bab2c96-015b-4fef-9741-4a7fda76b880\" data-macro-name=\"children\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114206168/Bacteriology+Results+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114206168\" data-link